    """
    It is an optional parameter, but it's only required when using
    'AUTHENTICATION_SALES_FORCE' or 'AUTHENTICATION_IDFY' as a parameter value
    under 'mechanism'. For 'AUTHENTICATION_IDFY' it's requestId
    """
